{
  "_README": [
    "Recorded number-lookup responses, one per line type the gate has to tell",
    "apart. Shapes only — every number is in the 555 reserved range and every",
    "carrier name is a real one taken from public documentation, so nothing here",
    "identifies a person or a business.",
    "",
    "These are replayed through the SDK's own response model in",
    "tests/test_lookup_provider.py rather than fed to the provider as loose",
    "dicts. That is the point of the file: a fixture the SDK refuses to parse is",
    "a pin that no longer matches the code, and this project has already shipped",
    "one of those and found out on the morning of a sale.",
    "",
    "No test in this repo calls the real API. See the module docstring."
  ],
